# audit-layer-b.names.local.example
#
# Template for scripts/audit-layer-b.names.local — the real, operator-local
# Layer B denylist for scripts/audit-layer-b.sh and scripts/pre-publish-scan.sh
# (docs/PUBLISH_ORPHAN_PLAN.md, Decision Point 2, Option B).
#
# The two audit scripts ship with a placeholder denylist so the checks stay
# exercised in the published tree without embedding any real private name.
# To run the FULL check locally:
#
#   1. cp scripts/audit-layer-b.names.local.example scripts/audit-layer-b.names.local
#   2. Edit the copy: one forbidden name/token per line. Multi-word names
#      need double quotes, exactly as they'd appear in a shell word list,
#      e.g.  "Multi Word Name"
#   3. scripts/audit-layer-b.names.local is gitignored — it never gets
#      committed or published. Verify with:
#        git check-ignore -v scripts/audit-layer-b.names.local
#
# Example content (replace with your own real names):
PrivateAgentNameOne
PrivateAgentNameTwo
"Multi Word Private Name"
operator-real-name
